WEBVTT

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:12.888
All right. Happy?

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:17.017
One down, two to go.

00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:18.310
(TIRES SCREECHING)

00:00:20.229 --> 00:00:21.230
(SIREN WAILING)

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:28.862
They went that way, officer.

00:00:29.071 --> 00:00:30.948
-(GUNS COCKING)
-Hands up.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.411
What the hell is that?

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:39.289
(GULPS)

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:40.707
Lion.

00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:41.917
(LION GROWLING)

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:51.260
NEWT: You know,

00:00:51.468 --> 00:00:55.013
New York is considerably
more interesting than I'd expected.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:02.771
(OSTRICH SCREECHING)

00:01:03.605 --> 00:01:04.606
(WHIMPERS)

00:01:07.109 --> 00:01:08.485
(CREATURE LOWING)

00:01:11.238 --> 00:01:12.614
Put this on.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:16.201
But why would I have to wear
something like this?

00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:19.580
Because your skull is susceptible
to breakage under immense force.

00:01:25.836 --> 00:01:28.630
(LOWING CONTINUES)

00:01:36.221 --> 00:01:37.222
(TINA SIGHS)

00:01:40.142 --> 00:01:42.144
But we made 'em cocoa.

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:44.104
(LOWING CONTINUES)

00:01:44.646 --> 00:01:45.647
All right.

00:01:49.443 --> 00:01:52.154
Here, you just, um, pop this on.

00:01:53.071 --> 00:01:54.281
Okay.

00:01:54.448 --> 00:01:57.492
Now there's absolutely
nothing for you to worry about.

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:00.996
Tell me, has anyone ever believed you
when you told them not to worry?

00:02:01.163 --> 00:02:04.291
Well, my philosophy is that
worrying means you suffer twice.

00:02:07.836 --> 00:02:09.463
(CREATURE LOWING)

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:11.173
She's in season.

00:02:11.673 --> 00:02:13.675
She needs to mate.

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:15.135
(SPITS)

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:20.641
Erumpent musk. She's mad for it.

00:02:22.392 --> 00:02:23.393
(SNIFFS)

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:36.657
(LOWING)

00:02:37.616 --> 00:02:38.617
(ERUMPENT LOWING)

00:02:38.784 --> 00:02:42.788
MILITARY MACAW
ARA MILITARIS

00:02:43.705 --> 00:02:45.290
(NEWT SNORTING)

00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:04.017
(CONTINUES SNORTING)

00:03:29.418 --> 00:03:30.752
Good girl.

00:03:30.919 --> 00:03:31.920
(LOWING)

00:03:32.337 --> 00:03:33.505
Come on.

00:03:33.672 --> 00:03:34.965
Into the case.

00:03:39.344 --> 00:03:40.345
(SNIFFS)

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:44.391
(SEAL BARKING)

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:46.226
Get!

00:03:46.393 --> 00:03:47.394
(SNIFFING CONTINUES)

00:03:52.441 --> 00:03:53.692
Oh, no.

00:03:56.611 --> 00:03:57.612
(SNORTS)

00:04:00.449 --> 00:04:01.450
(SCREAMING)

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:23.305
-Reparo.
-(BABOON CHITTERING)

00:04:26.183 --> 00:04:27.225
Merlin's beard!

00:04:32.314 --> 00:04:33.398
Tree!

00:04:33.648 --> 00:04:35.442
They're exactly the same.

00:04:37.194 --> 00:04:38.195
Same thing.

00:04:38.487 --> 00:04:39.738
Newt!

00:04:40.822 --> 00:04:41.823
(ERUMPENT LOWING)

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:43.283
(GRUNTS)

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.202
No, don't.

00:04:46.077 --> 00:04:48.079
-(SCREECHES)
-I'm so sorry.

00:04:59.591 --> 00:05:00.592
(BUBBLING)

00:05:09.059 --> 00:05:10.060
(GRUNTING)

00:05:12.521 --> 00:05:13.522
(YELPING)

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:39.881
(LOWING)

00:05:42.259 --> 00:05:43.802
(BOTH PANTING)

00:05:46.638 --> 00:05:48.723
Good show, Mr. Kowalski.

00:05:51.518 --> 00:05:52.727
Call me Jacob.

00:06:01.319 --> 00:06:04.489
NEWT: Well... Two down, one to go.

00:06:09.244 --> 00:06:10.579
In you hop.

00:06:11.413 --> 00:06:12.831
(FOOTSTEPS RECEDING)

00:06:20.964 --> 00:06:22.757
(PANTING)

00:06:26.887 --> 00:06:28.179
ANNOUNCER: Ladies and gentlemen...

00:06:28.847 --> 00:06:31.474
Tonight's keynote speaker

00:06:32.225 --> 00:06:34.728
needs no introduction from me.

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:36.813
He's been mentioned as a future president.

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:38.690
SHAW
AMERICA'S FUTURE

00:06:39.274 --> 00:06:41.026
And if you don't believe me,

00:06:41.192 --> 00:06:42.527
just read his daddy's newspapers.

00:06:43.236 --> 00:06:44.613
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:06:46.531 --> 00:06:47.657
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:06:47.824 --> 00:06:51.661
I give you the senator
for New York, Henry Shaw.

00:06:52.203 --> 00:06:53.204
(AUDIENCE CHEERING)

00:06:57.459 --> 00:06:58.501
Thank you.

00:06:59.961 --> 00:07:01.254
Thank you.

00:07:05.717 --> 00:07:06.843
Thank you.

00:07:14.809 --> 00:07:16.019
(HISSING)

00:07:27.697 --> 00:07:28.698
(LIGHT BULB SHATTERS)

00:07:31.576 --> 00:07:32.786
SENATOR SHAW: And it's true,

00:07:33.161 --> 00:07:35.246
we have made some progress.

00:07:36.331 --> 00:07:38.959
But there is no reward for idleness.

00:07:39.376 --> 00:07:44.422
So just as the odious saloons
have been banished...

00:07:44.589 --> 00:07:46.132
(FEEDBACK)

00:07:48.218 --> 00:07:49.511
(HISSING)

00:07:58.019 --> 00:08:00.855
So now the pool halls,

00:08:01.523 --> 00:08:03.566
and these private parlors--

00:08:03.858 --> 00:08:05.527
(SNARLING)

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:16.621
What is that?

00:08:18.957 --> 00:08:21.042
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:08:25.797 --> 00:08:26.798
(YELPS)

00:08:33.221 --> 00:08:35.056
-(PEOPLE SCREAMING)
-SHAW SENIOR: No! No!

